    "updated_at": "2015-11-04T15:43:21Z",
    "body": "This is basically https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=23878. Once a window goes away the fetch group needs to be terminated, which terminates all the fetches.\n\nNot sure what the stop UI should do. Does it typically prevent any further fetches? As a user I'm never quite sure what that button does.\n",
