    "created_at": "2015-11-04T17:32:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-11-04T17:32:01Z",
    "body": "- So yes, the race condition does exist. Not sure what to do about it.\n- Perhaps the service worker ought to be notified when a fetch is terminated. This is something it cannot currently act upon.\n- Perhaps when you have a \"passthrough\" fetch of sorts they should become linked, and terminate one terminates the other? \n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
